 "overview": "About the Activity:\nThe brilliant tour of Hanoi and Ha Long in Vietnam features the charming capital of Hanoi, with an overnight cruise in the magnificent Ha Long Bay.\nArrive\r\nat Noi Bai International airport and get transferred to your\r\nhotel and by late afternoon, visit Hoan Kiem Lake and Ngoc Son Temple located on an islet in the lake.\nYou can spot very rare species of giant turtles in the Hoan Kiem Lake which is the centre point of Hanoi.\nHa Long, the world heritage site is repleted with limestone karsts and islets in various shapes and sizes.Have the majestic sights of Dinh Huong Island, Ga Choi Island, Dog\r\nIsland, Sail Island and make a visit to Sung Sot Cave and swimming stop at Titov Beach on second day. \nRelax and enjoy the bay view at sunset, aftermath you will have your dinner and you can go for fishing at 09:00 PM, also spend the night on board.\nWander\r\naround the tranquil Hoan Kiem Lake on third day, sip strong traditional coffee at a café\r\nin the Old Quarter while watching people pass by.\n\nVisit Ho Chi Minh complex on the fourth day and also take a glance of the Presidential House and later in the afternoon get transferred to the airport for your departure.\nIf\r\nyou are first-time visitor to North Vietnam, this tour is the perfect fit for you.",
